Error [E0957]: `find` glob escapes the project with `..`
  --> tests/ui/comptime_find_dotdot.jet:1:21
    |
  1 | PATHS :: comptime { find("../*.jet") }
    |                     ^^^^
 Why: `..` could read files outside your project; comptime inputs must stay inside it
 Fix: Drop the `..` and use a glob under this file's directory
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0957
